      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Expected Webhook Input\n\n```json\nPOST /webhook/lmstudio\n\n{\n  \"query\": \"Your question here\",\n  \"systemPromptName\": \"geography_expert\",\n  \"model\": \"qwen2.5-7b-instruct\"\n}\n```\n\n### Fields:\n- **query** (required): The user's question\n- **systemPromptName** (optional): Name key to fetch prompt from MongoDB. Default: \"default\"\n- **model** (optional): LM Studio model name. Default: \"qwen2.5-7b-instruct\"\n\n### MongoDB Collection: `system_prompts`\nExpected document structure:\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"geography_expert\",\n  \"prompt\": \"You are a helpful geography assistant...\"\n}\n```\n\n### Available Models:\n- qwen2.5-7b-instruct\n- qwen2.5-3b-instruct\n- qwen2.5-3b-instruct-mlx",
